  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2403.01 Refunds of Unified Carrier Registration Fees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2403.01 Refunds of Unified Carrier Registration Fees. For purposes of section 10(d)(2) of the unified carrier registration agreement, the department shall not issue a refund of UCR fees to a registrant that ceases its operations before the beginning of the registration year for which fees were paid.\n\nSource. #12579, eff 7-20-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2400.html"
